{"author":"did:key:z6Mkmz8SWiUshwDMszSqwzMngt7ScNmsEj7vZoFRLjpcZTm9","evaluation":{"digest":{"sha256":"618e198893bdb1f839519fbc14f10866734676875377340bf17e6328e5d1295a"}},"instructions":"Return exactly ACCEPT or REJECT.","network.jinn.binary-judgment.item-sha256":"sha256:3d7b23754e610079f41d756e8e0747c77daa85bf9153a68599ac7fab9c451b37","outputs":[{"mediaType":"text/plain; charset=utf-8","name":"judge-response","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.jinn.binary-judgment.observation.v1+json","name":"judge-observation","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.inspect-ai.eval-log+json","name":"inspect-log","required":false}],"payload":{"candidateAnswer":"Camping trip in the outdoors","evidence":"[D2:1 | 7:11 pm on 24 May, 2023] Evan: Hey Sam, good to hear from you! Since we last talked, lots has been happening! Last weekend, I took my family on a road trip to Jasper. It was amazing! We drove through the Icefields Parkway and the glaciers and lakes were gorgeous. I got a shot of a glacier, check it out!\n[D2:3 | 7:11 pm on 24 May, 2023] Evan: Hey Sam, thanks for asking! It was great - fresh air, peacefulness and a cozy cabin surrounded by mountains and forests made it feel like a real retreat.\n[D19:1 | 1:45 pm on 9 December, 2023] Evan: Hey Sam, hope you're doing good. Wanted to share some amazing news - my partner is pregnant! We're so excited! It's been a while since we had a kiddo around.\n[D19:3 | 1:45 pm on 9 December, 2023] Evan: So excited and a bit nervous! It's been a while since I had a toddler around but I'm really looking forward to it. Parenthood is so rewarding. I still remember when my first child was born, the joy was amazing. Looking forward to witness the miracle of life and build more memories with my family!","itemId":"urn:uuid:de137cdb-f295-5a2d-87fb-c7e6224c5ce8","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:7089d8ebaf3f3bd5325a94fa3861f7f7a13ed42579b63324a4aaaa6e163db71b","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Which type of vacation would Evan prefer with his family, walking tours in metropolitan cities or camping trip in the outdoors?","referenceAnswer":"camping trip in the outdoors","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"7089d8ebaf3f3bd5325a94fa3861f7f7a13ed42579b63324a4aaaa6e163db71b"}}]},"profile":{"digest":{"sha256":"ebb34d8362e2cc3135847a5ad6f3ee3d9c2d9922a2b827aa9dfcbaf440b22557"},"uri":"https://spec.jinn.network/task-profiles/binary-judgment/2.0"},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/profiles/task-execution/v1"}